      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers commend specific salon stylists like Johanna, Mayra, and Asal for their accommodating and gentle grooming work on small dogs, as well as knowledgeable floor associates like Andrea. In contrast, several clients express deep dissatisfaction with pet hotel reception, citing rude treatment of senior dog owners and cancelled boarding reservations."
      }
    },
